‎## 1. Observation — Documented, Not Claimed
‎
‎**Statement:**
‎
‎Across recent Reddit discussions and OpenAI community forums, recurring friction clustering around ChatGPT is observable around:
‎
‎- usage limits (5-hour limits reinstated for Plus, weekly quotas)【863393940621461249†L166-L179】
‎- degraded / changed performance, fallback behavior (GPT-4 mini fallback mid-session, rushed/robotic responses, cost-optimized response engine)【863393940621461249†L76-L86】【863393940621461249†L51-L67】【863393940621461249†L132-L144】
