‎## 2. Crossroads Framing — Why This Signal is Sharp
‎
‎> Limits → Performance → Portability → Choice
‎
‎Gate-network observation:
‎
‎| Friction | User Question | Gate |
‎| :--- | :--- | :--- |
‎| Limits (5-hour, weekly) | Can I continue? | Continuity — can work proceed?【863393940621461249†L166-L179】 |
‎| Degraded/changed performance, fallback to mini, architecture collapse | Can I still trust this tool for my work? | Reliability — is output trustworthy for real work?【863393940621461249†L76-L86】【863393940621461249†L93-L102】 |
