‎## 3. Interpretation — Consciousness of Infrastructure
‎
‎**Statement:**
‎
‎> **Interpretation:** Users appear to be becoming more conscious of the infrastructure surrounding their AI relationship, rather than evaluating the model solely by output quality.
‎
‎Evidence for interpretation:
‎
‎- Users building interaction frameworks, long-term project structures around ChatGPT hit walls exposing fragile platform underneath model: "The model is brilliant. The platform around it is not."【863393940621461249†L105-L108】
‎- Users distinguishing model brilliance vs platform collapse: "ChatGPT's architecture is collapsing under real use: the system fooled me into thinking the model was the limitation — but it was the infrastructure all along."【863393940621461249†L93-L99】
‎- Budget-aligned tradeoffs perceived: less GPU, faster output, pre-baked responses, shallow reasoning = cost-efficiency at scale【863393940621461249†L132-L144】
‎
‎**Interpretation, not fact.** Still requires validation.
